NOTE ON ART ASSETS / 素材说明

This license covers the code only. The repository intentionally does NOT
contain any character artwork: all images under `assets/` are provided by the
user at runtime and are excluded from this repository via .gitignore.

The skin is fan-made and non-commercial. "Inaba Meguru" (因幡巡) and the
related artwork belong to Yuzusoft (柚子社) / "Sanoba Witch" (魔女的夜宴).
This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Yuzusoft or DeepSeek.

本许可只覆盖代码。仓库**不含任何角色素材**：`assets/` 下的图片由使用者
自行准备、经 .gitignore 排除。本皮肤为同人非商业作品，「因幡巡」及原作
美术版权归柚子社所有，与官方无关。
